    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but they're right though. the person they're talking about is the one people saw. the \"real me\" doesn't matter if nobody wants to see it. there's no way to go back. it's like i'm existing in a world where i don't belong anymore, just waiting for the realization to catch up with the reality. it feels so empty.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
